cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "roles (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  Agents made fully autonomous, each with a proof of reliability (Lean, a statistic with its sample, or a reference), packaged to be served like tool servers. A literature review is written and ends on a named baseline; no role is published yet.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tewf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tewf/roles"
license:
